{"id":"word:hebrew:H3083","type":"word","title":"יְהוֹנָתָן","subtitle":"H3083 • Hebrew word","simple":{"meaning":"Jehonathan , the name of four Israelites","inThisVerse":"The selected word is tied to יְהוֹנָתָן (H3083) in the Hebrew source text. Part of speech: n-pr-m.","whyItMatters":"This word appears 80 times in the Hebrew Bible, so BibleIQ can compare how Scripture uses it across multiple passages.","summary":"יְהוֹנָתָן (Yᵉhôwnâthân) means Jehonathan , the name of four Israelites First listed occurrence: 1Chr 8 33."},"evidence":{"originalLanguage":{"source":"hebrew","word":"יְהוֹנָתָן","transliteration":"Yᵉhôwnâthân","pronunciation":"yeh-ho-naw-thawn'","strong":"H3083","lemmaId":"hebrew:H3083","partOfSpeech":"n-pr-m","forms":["יְה֣וֹנָתָ֔ן","יְהוֹנָתָ֖ן","יְהוֹנָתָ֣ן","יְהֽוֹנָתָן֙","יְהוֹנָתָ֛ן"],"morphs":[["HNp",63],["HC/Np",13],["HR/Np",3],["HC/R/Np",1]]},"definitions":{"short":"Jehonathan , the name of four Israelites","usage":"Jonathan. Compare 3129 .","full":"H3083. Yehonathan יוֺנָתָן יְהוֺנָתָן, proper name, masculine ᵐ5 Ἰωναθαν through-out, with occasional variant reading ( ׳י hath given ; compare נְתַנְאֵל נְתַנְיָהוּ, אֶלְנָתָן, & references, Temanite רמננתן Hal RÉJ 1884, ix. 7 f. Nbr Stud. Bib. i. 211 ; Sabean והבאום , Hal 10 ) — 1 ׳יְהוֺ son of Saul 1Sam 14:6 , 8 ; 18:1 (twice in verse) + 40 t. 1Samuel; 2Sam 1:4 18 t. 2Samuel; 1Chr 8:33-34 , 9:39-40 , = ׳יוֺ 1Sam 13:2 , 327t. 1Samuel; 1Chr 10:2 . 2 ׳יְהוֺ son of Abiathar 2Sam 15:27 , 36 ; 17:17 , 20 ; = ׳יוֺ 1Kin 1:42-43 ,. 3 ׳יְהוֺ nephew of David 2Sam 21:21 = 1Chr 20:7 ; apparently: called Jonadab 2Sam 13:3 ff. where ᵐ5 L Ἰωναθαν , compare יהונדב 2 4 ׳יְהוֺ ; דּוֺד of David, i.e. his uncle? 1Chr 27:32 . 5 ׳יְהוֺ one of David's heroes 2Sam 23:32 (compare Dr) = יוֺנָתָן 1Chr 11:34 . 6 ׳יְהוֺ one of David's treasurers 1Chr 27:25 . 7 ׳יְהוֺ Scribe Jer 37:15 , 20 . 38:26 . 8 Levites a. ׳יְהוֺ 2Chr 17:8 ; b. ׳יוֺ Neh 12:35 . 9 ׳יְהוֺ a priest Neh 12:18 . 10 ׳יְהוֺ priest to the tribe of Dan, son of Gershom Judg 18:30 . 11 ׳יוֺ a Judaite captain, after fall of Jerusalem Jer 40:8 . 12 ׳יוֺ a Judaite 1Chr 2:32-33 ,. 13 ׳יוֺ father of Ebed Ezra 8:6 . 14 ׳יוֺ son of Asahel Ezra 10:15 . 15 ׳יוֺ a priest Neh 12:14 . 16 ׳יוֺ a son of Joiada Neh 12:11 (twice in verse) apparently = יְהוֺחָנָן 2","rootNote":"from 3068 and 5414 ; Jehovah-given;","sources":["MorphHB occurrences","Strong Hebrew Dictionary","Brown-Driver-Briggs"]},"firstMention":"1Chr 8 33","keyReferences":["1Chr 8 33","1Chr 8 34","1Chr 9 39","1Chr 9 40","1Chr 20 7","1Chr 27 25","1Chr 27 32","1Sam 14 6"],"related":{"people":[],"places":[],"concepts":[],"events":[]},"occurrenceCount":80,"occurrences":[{"reference":"1Chr 8 33","book":"1Chr","chapter":8,"verse":33,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְהֽוֹנָתָן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 8 34","book":"1Chr","chapter":8,"verse":34,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְהוֹנָתָ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 39","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":39,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְהֽוֹנָתָן֙","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 9 40","book":"1Chr","chapter":9,"verse":40,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְהוֹנָתָ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 20 7","book":"1Chr","chapter":20,"verse":7,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְה֣וֹנָתָ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 25","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":25,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְהוֹנָתָ֖ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Chr 27 32","book":"1Chr","chapter":27,"verse":32,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"וִֽ/יהוֹנָתָ֤ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HC/Np"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 6","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":6,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְהוֹנָתָ֜ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Sam 14 8","book":"1Sam","chapter":14,"verse":8,"englishText":"","sourceWord":"יְה֣וֹנָתָ֔ן","source":"hebrew","morph":"HNp"},{"reference":"1Sam 18 1","book":"1Sam","chapter":18,"verse":1,"englishT